    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiny crabs are lost! They need your help to find their way home. <strong>Every move matters!\u00a0\u00a0</strong> <br>With movement cards, you'll guide each one through beautiful, handcrafted puzzles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727480/extras/c28785fbe4ad5527b5b8c0e04dbc9a8f.poster.avif?t=1753889349\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727480/extras/c28785fbe4ad5527b5b8c0e04dbc9a8f.webm?t=1753889349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727480/extras/c28785fbe4ad5527b5b8c0e04dbc9a8f.mp4?t=1753889349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adjust the world around you with care.</strong> Each level is a gentle puzzle where positioning and timing matter. Help all the crabs come back home safely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727480/extras/eb9edff3b0ea1125708aa118111e7260.poster.avif?t=1753889349\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727480/extras/eb9edff3b0ea1125708aa118111e7260.webm?t=1753889349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727480/extras/eb9edff3b0ea1125708aa118111e7260.mp4?t=1753889349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a peaceful, <strong>turn-based</strong> <strong>puzzle game</strong> designed to let you take your time.\u00a0<br>No timers. No pressure. Just clever challenges, soft visuals, and a slow sense of satisfaction as each baby crab finds its way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727480/extras/a74bab446d620754bd03ea517034c933.poster.avif?t=1753889349\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727480/extras/a74bab446d620754bd03ea517034c933.webm?t=1753889349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727480/extras/a74bab446d620754bd03ea517034c933.mp4?t=1753889349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udccf Movement card system: plan each crab\u2019s steps with simple, intuitive mechanics<br>\ud83c\udf0d Environmental manipulation: reshape levels to create new paths and solutions <br>\ud83e\udd80 Dozens of handcrafted puzzles: each one a small, relaxing challenge<br>\ud83e\udde0 No pressure: undo freely, experiment, and enjoy at your own pace <br>\ud83c\udfb5 Gentle music and soft visuals: for a cozy, meditative mood</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why You\u2019ll Love It?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy puzzle games that are calm but clever, this one\u2019s for you. <br>There\u2019s something satisfying about watching a tiny crab disappear into a glowing portal,\u00a0 especially knowing you paved the way.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiny crabs are lost! They need your help to find their way home. <strong>Every move matters!\u00a0\u00a0</strong> <br>With movement cards, you'll guide each one through beautiful, handcrafted puzzles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727480/extras/c28785fbe4ad5527b5b8c0e04dbc9a8f.poster.avif?t=1753889349\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727480/extras/c28785fbe4ad5527b5b8c0e04dbc9a8f.webm?t=1753889349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727480/extras/c28785fbe4ad5527b5b8c0e04dbc9a8f.mp4?t=1753889349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adjust the world around you with care.</strong> Each level is a gentle puzzle where positioning and timing matter. Help all the crabs come back home safely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727480/extras/eb9edff3b0ea1125708aa118111e7260.poster.avif?t=1753889349\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727480/extras/eb9edff3b0ea1125708aa118111e7260.webm?t=1753889349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727480/extras/eb9edff3b0ea1125708aa118111e7260.mp4?t=1753889349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a peaceful, <strong>turn-based</strong> <strong>puzzle game</strong> designed to let you take your time.\u00a0<br>No timers. No pressure. Just clever challenges, soft visuals, and a slow sense of satisfaction as each baby crab finds its way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727480/extras/a74bab446d620754bd03ea517034c933.poster.avif?t=1753889349\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727480/extras/a74bab446d620754bd03ea517034c933.webm?t=1753889349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727480/extras/a74bab446d620754bd03ea517034c933.mp4?t=1753889349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udccf Movement card system: plan each crab\u2019s steps with simple, intuitive mechanics<br>\ud83c\udf0d Environmental manipulation: reshape levels to create new paths and solutions <br>\ud83e\udd80 Dozens of handcrafted puzzles: each one a small, relaxing challenge<br>\ud83e\udde0 No pressure: undo freely, experiment, and enjoy at your own pace <br>\ud83c\udfb5 Gentle music and soft visuals: for a cozy, meditative mood</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why You\u2019ll Love It?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy puzzle games that are calm but clever, this one\u2019s for you. <br>There\u2019s something satisfying about watching a tiny crab disappear into a glowing portal,\u00a0 especially knowing you paved the way.</p>",
